  source_bar_position: can be left or right edge [observed] source bar is always vertically above target bar
  transformation:
    per_marker: |
      1. Paint teal from source bar to marker (exclusive of bar, exclusive of marker), recolor marker yellow.
      2. Use marker's row-offset in source bar to find corresponding row of opposite (target) bar.
      3. Paint full teal ray from target bar across entire row (bar cell stays red).

generation_strategy:
